[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/Combat/Actions/ActionDefinitionResource.cs" id="2_action"]

; The Ashen Knight's greatsword (the finish run, Act IV). Modelled on the Iron King's maul chain and
; built to be its opposite: where the King telegraphs one huge blow, the Knight chains three quick
; ones. Cut -> cut -> thrust. The two cuts are interruptible (the punish window a duel needs); the
; closing thrust is not, and it warps further than the King's slam, because a duelist closes.
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="CutA"]
